<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In What Makes Diffusion Language Models Super Data Learners?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Related Work</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS1" title="In 5 Related Work ‣ What Makes Diffusion Language Models Super Data Learners?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.1 </span>Data Efficiency in Language Modeling</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In 5 Related Work ‣ What Makes Diffusion Language Models Super Data Learners?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2 </span>Diffusion vs. Autoregressive Under Data Constraints</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
